<title>POLAND: KPBP BICK WINS PLN 6.4 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>KPBP BICK WINS PLN 6.4 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm KPBP Bick SA won a 6.4 million zloty contract for providing desulphurisation equipment at the Polaniec power station in southeastern Poland, Bick said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Work on the project must be completed by June 30, 1998.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
